   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "About this workflow",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Activation Probe & Steering (experimental)\n\n**\u2460 Probe a run**: records per-layer activation statistics (std, rms, mean, \u2026) at every denoising step, without changing the image. The heat map shows which layers carry energy when.\n\n**\u2461 Watch a bend propagate**: the same run with a bend (\u00d72 at `input_blocks.4.1`), compared against \u2460. Red = activations larger than unbent, blue = smaller. Upstream layers stay white.\n\n**\u2462 Steer with a prompt pair**: the difference between the mean activations of a *winter* and a *summer* run becomes a direction you can add to *any* prompt. Strength 0 = off, negative = towards summer.\n\nLoaders match an LCM-Dreamshaper setup (6 steps, cfg 1.5). Any SD1.5 checkpoint works: raise steps/cfg to taste."
   ],
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": []
  },
