   "title": "Tips",
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Tips**\n- Keep A and B identical except for the concept words.\n- Site: `output_blocks.5.1` (style/colour, keeps layout). Try `output_blocks.4.1`, `8.1` or `middle_block.1`. The probes below record all of them.\n- Strength ~2\u20133 is a clear push. **Negative** steers towards B. 8+ breaks the image.\n- Change the **Prompt** on the left: the direction transfers to other subjects.\n- `t_start`/`t_end` limit steering to part of the denoising (1 = noise, 0 = image). E.g. 0.8\u21920 keeps the composition.\n- `mode=spatial` (needs `stats+spatial_means`) also transfers the layout."
   ],
